sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer Server + GAM
  participant O as Personal Server + GAM
  actor H as Human / trusted chat
  C->>O: Pulse approval.request
  O->>H: Show the frozen presentation
  O-->>C: Pulse signed approval.presented
